{
    "title": "Witch's Tale",
    "description": "\u25a0Hot Features\u25a0\r\n\r\n-Choice-based Story\r\nExplore various story endings shaped by your strategic choices. Craft your own destiny.\r\n\r\n-Enchanting Wardrobe\r\nUse your magic and imagination to create special styles. Be the fashion icon in Magnus City.\r\n\r\n-Dangerous Romance\r\nMay your lover be a werewolf, vampire, or warlock? Solve the identity mysteries of the sexy and compelling characters within a thrilling and romantic experience.\r\n\r\n-Cultivate Your Dream Team\r\nNurture meaningful connections, cultivate allies, and tackle challenges together.\r\n\r\n-Magical Pet & Elves\r\nRaise your lovely companions. Initiate your mystical business by crafting and selling enchanting artifacts. \r\n\r\n\u25a0Synopsis\u25a0\r\nA mysterious dream has always haunted you...\r\nIn a dark, void-like cosmic space, a black cat from the underworld attempts to communicate with you. Hidden within your bloodline lies an ancient secret, a power poised to influence the balance between magic and reality. The sealed, mysterious force is on the brink of awakening, and your destiny is intertwined with the fate of this world...\r\n\r\nNo, this is not just a dream.\r\nThe strange accident that claimed your father's life, your mother's evasive secrecy, and the increasingly frequent, unexplainable phenomena in your life...\r\nYou are at the center of it all.\r\n\r\n\u25a0Websites\u25a0\r\nJoin our OFFICIAL COMMUNITIES for game details, latest updates, exclusive giveaways, and more!\r\n\r\nFacebook:\u00a0https://www.facebook.com/WitchsTaleDL\r\nDiscord:\u00a0https://discord.gg/AdxNhwqBmA\r\nOfficial Website:\u00a0https://witch.oriwish.com",
